ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJjYFpJXA18UUvtAt7yhQOAcbB5lcHioe6bgAdi0QWB1A&oe=6AAD2E5F"}, {"file_name": "objects.png", "id": "1880366796700358", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824322_1880366806700357_8356420363446108696_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1OxL_G-xAz8Q7kNvwFIBjLv&_nc_oc=Adq3rrgLsFI_-4ZuuaTsppf71ULmJQHTED7ir0PWXhoOP7583TkBzQmqf5e9oUw9Zps&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK1dj7f-G82Rn_ZyI_fpmPRfq-Np617LoqV9cKY0gKhlw&oe=6AAD50DD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Blendimals", "keywords": ["animals", "kids", "creatures", "family", "mixing"], "long_description": "Welcome to Blendimals!\n\nStep into a magical forest and use your controllers to mix cute animals with everyday objects \u2014 and discover what adorable hybrid creatures appear!\n\nHow to Play:\nPick up an animal, mix it with an object, and see which unique hybrid creature is revealed. Simple to learn, endlessly surprising!\n\nFeatures:\n- Unique hybrid creatures** to discover and unlock\n- Beautiful VR forest environment** with a stunning night sky\n- Designed for kids** \u2014 simple, intuitive, and safe\n- No ads, no in-app purchases** \u2014 just pure fun\n- Supports Meta Quest controllers**\n\nPerfect for the Whole Family\nBlendimals is designed for children but enjoyed by the whole family. Simple enough for the youngest players, surprising enough to delight everyone.\n\n## A World Full of Surprises\nEvery combination reveals a new creature. What happens when you mix a bat with a cactus? Or a dragon with a cloud? Jump in and find out!", "short_description": "Mix cute animals with everyday objects and discover adorable hybrid creatures in a magical VR forest! Easy to pick up, impossible to put down. Perfect for the whole family!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://blendimals.web.app/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of